  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_system_01",
      "hash64": "8CD6CF2F46920501",
      "text": "洛托洛托洛托洛托……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_00",
      "hash64": "93A3B6F57DD8E5EF",
      "text": "喂喂。\\n我是番红。[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_01",
      "hash64": "93A3B5F57DD8E43C",
      "text": "谢谢你叫了这么多人\\n来蓝莓学园。[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_02",
      "hash64": "93A3B8F57DD8E955",
      "text": "为了感谢你的功劳，\\n我要送你特别的礼物！[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_03",
      "hash64": "93A3B7F57DD8E7A2",
      "text": "那就是和蓝莓学园的……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]隐藏头头[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]对战的权利！[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_04",
      "hash64": "93A3B2F57DD8DF23",
      "text": "那么～\\n希望你现在就到入口来。[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_05",
      "hash64": "93A3B1F57DD8DD70",
      "text": "他也很期待见到你哦。\\n……那么，回见！[VAR 0x0114(0054)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0054"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_06",
      "hash64": "93A3B4F57DD8E289",
      "text": "咦？[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_07",
      "hash64": "93A3B3F57DD8E0D6",
      "text": "你来这儿做什么呀？\\n在等谁吗？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_01",
      "hash64": "A1EED9B4A0548D8B",
      "text": "等隐藏头头……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_02",
      "hash64": "A1EEDAB4A0548F3E",
      "text": "我被人叫来……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_08",
      "hash64": "93A3BEF57DD8F387",
      "text": "这样啊，这样啊！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_09",
      "hash64": "93A3BDF57DD8F1D4",
      "text": "那么～\\n差不多该揭秘了！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_10",
      "hash64": "93A030F57DD5CC66",
      "text": "我就是番红～！\\n没想到吧！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_11",
      "hash64": "93A031F57DD5CE19",
      "text": "多亏了[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你，\\n蓝莓学园有很多人\\r\\n和社团都充满了活力。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_12",
      "hash64": "93A02EF57DD5C900",
      "text": "我作为校长，\\n真心对你表示感谢。\\r\\n实在太谢谢你了！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_13",
      "hash64": "93A02FF57DD5CAB3",
      "text": "然后，我，这个校长……[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_14",
      "hash64": "93A034F57DD5D332",
      "text": "正是蓝莓学园最强的\\n……隐藏头头！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_15",
      "hash64": "93A035F57DD5D4E5",
      "text": "如果说表面上最强的\\n是蓝莓联盟冠军，\\r\\n那隐藏头头就是幕后最强的。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_16",
      "hash64": "93A032F57DD5CFCC",
      "text": "对手是你的话，\\n我也许能打得很开心。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_17",
      "hash64": "93A033F57DD5D17F",
      "text": "那么，话不多说，\\n我们开始吧……[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_18",
      "hash64": "93A038F57DD5D9FE",
      "text": "我会拿出全力的，\\n你可要撑久一点哦～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_19",
      "hash64": "93A039F57DD5DBB1",
      "text": "哎呀～你太厉害了～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n我都几十年没输过了～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_20",
      "hash64": "939CCAF57DD2E93D",
      "text": "哎呀～连隐藏头头都被\\n蓝莓联盟冠军打倒的话，那……[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21",
      "hash64": "939CC9F57DD2E78A",
      "text": "该怎么称呼你才好呢？\\n嗯……蓝莓之王怎么样？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21b",
      "hash64": "A6531424CD600F38",
      "text": "该怎么称呼你才好呢？\\n嗯……蓝莓女王怎么样？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_03",
      "hash64": "A1EEDBB4A05490F1",
      "text": "真不错！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_select_04",
      "hash64": "A1EEDCB4A05492A4",
      "text": "这有点……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_22",
      "hash64": "939CC8F57DD2E5D7",
      "text": "算啦，称呼不重要！\\n总之恭喜你！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_23",
      "hash64": "939CC7F57DD2E424",
      "text": "你打倒了隐藏头头，\\n我要给你特别的奖励哦。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "8E3ED08217B878F9",
      "text": "感觉心情真不错，\\n总想再送你点什么～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "8E3ECF8217B87746",
      "text": "……对了！\\n我们交换宝可梦吧？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "8E3ECE8217B87593",
      "text": "我用斑斑马来换，\\n跟我交换宝可梦吧！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "8E3ECD8217B873E0",
      "text": "只要是你给我的宝可梦，\\n不论是哪个孩子我都热烈欢迎哦～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "8E3ED48217B87FC5",
      "text": "是[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊～！嗯！\\n真不错！谢谢你！\\c\\n我给你的斑斑马颜色很稀有，\\n很厉害吧～！要好好珍惜哦～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
